cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Zero Authority Witness"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
abstract: "A receipt-bearing intake membrane that converts untrusted content into hash-receipted, data-only evidence before LLM reasoning or action. It reduces first-contact authority risk and never grants authority to external content; it does not solve prompt injection or guarantee safety."
type: software
authors:
